9,Western Dani language | Laskon Wiki | Fandom,https://laskon.fandom.com/wiki/Western_Dani_language,"Western Dani, or Lani, is a Nuclear-Trans-New Guinea language. It is the Papuan language with the most speakers in Indonesian New Guinea.",Gavak,Trans-New Guinea
